      "extractedText": "Republic of the Philippines\nProvince of Iloilo\nMUNICIPALITY OF MIAGAO\nBIDS AND AWARDS COMMITTEE\nwebsite : www.miagao.gov.ph\nemail address: Igumiagao@yahoo.com\nINVITATION TO BID FOR THE CONCRETING OF BRGY. BAYBAY NORTE ROAD SECTION\nAND CONCRETING OF BRGY. OYUNGAN - BRGY. IGCABIDIO ROAD SECTION\n(MIAGAO, ILOILO)\n1. The Municipality of Miagao through the Budget for the Contract Approved by the\nSanggunian, Trust Fund (DILG-ADM), Budget Year 2017 intends to apply the sum of\nP 16,240,000.00 being the Approved Budget for the Contract (ABC) to payments under\nthe contract for the Concreting of Brgy. Baybay Norte Road Section and Concreting of\nBrgy. Oyungan-Brgy. Igcabidio Road Section (Miagao, Iloilo). Bids received in excess of the\nABC shall be automatically rejected at bid opening.\n2. The Municipality of Miagao now invites bids for the Concreting of Brgy. Baybay Norte\nRoad Section and Concreting of Brgy. Oyungan-Brgy. Igcabidio Road Section (Miagao,\nIloilo).\nITEM NO.\nQUANTITY\nUNIT\nITEM DESCRIPTION\nContract for furnishing of labor, materials, tools,\nequipments and other incidentals necessary for the\nconcreting of farm to market roads as per plan and\n1\n1\nJOB\nspecifications as follows:\nA. CONCRETING OF BRGY. BAYBAY NORTE ROAD SECTION\nUnit\nQuantity\nDescription\n1. Clearing and Grubbing of site\nsq.m.\n6,734\n2. Earthworks and structure excavation\nsq.m.\n6,660\n3. Aggregate Sub-Base Course\nsq.m.\n5,180\n4. Portland Cement Concrete Pavement (PCCP)\nsq.m.\n3,774\n5. Road Shouldering\nsq.m.\n1,480\n6. Concrete Line Ditch Canal\nL.m\n1,250\n7. Reinforced Concrete Pipe Culvert (RCPC)\n(4 units - 0.60m x 1.0m single barrel) (5 units - 0.90m x 1.0m\nL.m.\n64\nSingle barrel) (3 units - 0.60m x 1.0m junction pipe culvert\nIncluding concrete catch basin, headwall, wingwall and slab)",
      "ocrText": "Republic of the Philippines\nProvince of Iloilo\nMUNICIPALITY OF MIAGAO\nBIDS AND AWARDS COMMITTEE\nwebsite : www.miagao.gov.ph\nemail address: Igumiagao@yahoo.com\nINVITATION TO BID FOR THE CONCRETING OF BRGY. BAYBAY NORTE ROAD SECTION\nAND CONCRETING OF BRGY. OYUNGAN - BRGY. IGCABIDIO ROAD SECTION\n(MIAGAO, ILOILO)\n1. The Municipality of Miagao through the Budget for the Contract Approved by the\nSanggunian, Trust Fund (DILG-ADM), Budget Year 2017 intends to apply the sum of\nP 16,240,000.00 being the Approved Budget for the Contract (ABC) to payments under\nthe contract for the Concreting of Brgy. Baybay Norte Road Section and Concreting of\nBrgy. Oyungan-Brgy. Igcabidio Road Section (Miagao, Iloilo). Bids received in excess of the\nABC shall be automatically rejected at bid opening.\n2. The Municipality of Miagao now invites bids for the Concreting of Brgy. Baybay Norte\nRoad Section and Concreting of Brgy. Oyungan-Brgy. Igcabidio Road Section (Miagao,\nIloilo).\nITEM NO.\nQUANTITY\nUNIT\nITEM DESCRIPTION\nContract for furnishing of labor, materials, tools,\nequipments and other incidentals necessary for the\nconcreting of farm to market roads as per plan and\n1\n1\nJOB\nspecifications as follows:\nA. CONCRETING OF BRGY. BAYBAY NORTE ROAD SECTION\nUnit\nQuantity\nDescription\n1. Clearing and Grubbing of site\nsq.m.\n6,734\n2. Earthworks and structure excavation\nsq.m.\n6,660\n3. Aggregate Sub-Base Course\nsq.m.\n5,180\n4. Portland Cement Concrete Pavement (PCCP)\nsq.m.\n3,774\n5. Road Shouldering\nsq.m.\n1,480\n6. Concrete Line Ditch Canal\nL.m\n1,250\n7. Reinforced Concrete Pipe Culvert (RCPC)\n(4 units - 0.60m x 1.0m single barrel) (5 units - 0.90m x 1.0m\nL.m.\n64\nSingle barrel) (3 units - 0.60m x 1.0m junction pipe culvert\nIncluding concrete catch basin, headwall, wingwall and slab)",
